- [ ] Fallback morning notification can't follow Apple Health's sleep schedule: no public API #notifications #worth(later) #added(2026-11-12)
	> The fixed-time morning summary uses the band alarm + 30 min or a picked time. Apple
	> Health's sleep schedule (bedtime, wake-up) exists in the iOS 27.2 SDK only as private
	> symbols (SleepDaySummary.UserSettings.Schedule in HealthKit.tbd, absent from the
	> public Swift interface). Undecided: revisit if Apple publishes an API; private API
	> was rejected.
